  "name": "Piercing Gleam (10th+)",
  "type": "effect",
  "img": "icons/magic/light/beam-rays-yellow.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are inside a <strong>Piercing Gleam</strong> aura. You see as though in bright light regardless of actual conditions, and gain a +2 status bonus to saves against illusion, emotion and mental effects.</p>\n<p>You see through illusions, morphs and polymorphs, perceiving things as they truly are, and are immune to visual illusion effects. This never reveals an ally who wishes to remain hidden, and never helps an enemy see through anything.</p>\n<p>Creatures inside the aura cannot be Concealed, Hidden or Undetected from you. Your saves against effects that would make you Fascinated, Confused or Controlled are one degree better: switch <em>Piercing Gleam: mind save</em> on in your effects panel before such a save, and off after.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>This effect arrives and leaves with the aura. It does not need removing by hand.</p>",
      "gm": ""
    },
